      "title": "INSPECT: Home - IN.gov",
      "source_type": "web_search",
      "url": "https://www.in.gov/pla/inspect/",
      "excerpt": "INSPECT: Home\n\n Skip to main content\n\n An official website of the Indiana State Government\n\n Language Translation\n\n Governor Mike Braun\n\nMENU\n\n Indiana Professional Licensing Agency\n\n Start voice\n input\n\n Frequent Searches\n\n >Submit text\n search\n\n PLA\n\n INSPECT Home\n\n About INSPECT\n\n Toggle submenu\n\n Contact Us\n\n About\n\n INSPECT Integration Initiative\n\n INSPECT for Veterinarians\n\n Laws & Regulations\n\n Policies\n\n Registration Information\n\n Pharmacy Reporting\n\n Toggle submenu\n\n Compliance\n\n Error Correction\n\n Submitting Data\n\n Resources\n\n INSPECT User Guides\n\n Instructional Videos\n\n FAQs\n\n INSPECT Incident Report\n\nLearn More\n\n I Want To\n\n Toggle submenu\n\nRegister or Login to the WebCenter\n\nReset my WebCenter password\n\nSubmit an Anonymous Tip\n\n Online Services\n\n Toggle submenu\n\nLogin to INSPECT AWARxE\n\nLogin to INSPECT PMP Clearinghouse\n\nHelpdesk\n\nMore IN.gov Online Services\n\nIN.gov Subscriber Center\n\n Top FAQs\n\n Toggle submenu\n\n   Close Menu\n\nINSPECT News & Important Announcements\n\n General Announcements\n\nThe INSPECT Division will be migrating from PLA to the Indiana Department of Health in the upcoming months.  Please direct all correspondence solely to INSPECT@health.in.gov.  No calls can be taken at this time.\n\n The Indiana Prescription Monitoring Program (PDMP)\n\nTo register for the PDMP and to perform patient look-up requests please use the following link: https://indiana.pmpaware.net/login/\n\nPrescription data submissions must be submitted through the PMP Clearinghouse. Please use the following link: https://pmpclearinghouse.net\n\nIf you had an account on the original Indiana Prescription Monitoring Program system prior to October 11, 2017, do not submit a new application. You may access your account by clicking here and selecting \"Reset Password.\" A link to reset your password will be sent to the email address listed in your profile.\n\nIf you require technical assistance please contact support at 844-446-4767 or submit your request to inspect@pla.in.gov and someone will assist with account updates and password resets within 24 hours.\n\nThe following information will be required to process your request:\n\nFirst Name:\nLast Name:\nDOB:\n Individual email address (only the practitioner has access to):\nDEA #:\nProfessional License #:\nDriver's License #:\n\n Statewide Integration Announcement\n\nEffective August 24, 2017 Indiana will begin steps to implement a statewide, comprehensive platform for healthcare professionals to review patients' controlled-substance prescription history more quickly and efficiently. This platform supports Indiana's Prescription Drug Monitoring Program (INSPECT) and transfers data into electronic health records and pharmacy management systems. Statewide integration of the INSPECT platform is a key component of Indiana's ongoing efforts to attack the opioid crisis. For more information or to learn more about INSPECT integration please fill out the form below:\n\nThe INSPECT Integration application may be found here\n\nStatewide Integration Press Release\n\n AWARxE Platform Migration\n\nINSPECT migrated to the AWARxE platform on Wednesday, October 11, 2017.\n\nRequestor Users: So long as your account information is accurate, you should be automatically migrated to the new system.\n\nTo register for a Data Submitter Account: Please visit the PMP Clearinghouse to create a new account.  Be sure to complete all required fields.\n\nYou may find our new IN Data Submission Dispenser guide here\n\n I Want To\n\nRegister or Login to the WebCenter\n\nReset my WebCenter password\n\nSubmit an Anonymous Tip\n\n Online Services\n\nLogin to INSPECT AWARxE\n\nLogin to INSPECT PMP Clearinghouse\n\nHelpdesk\n\nMore IN.gov Online Services\n\nIN.gov Subscriber Center\n\n Top FAQs\n\nFind Information\n\n State Information Live Chat\n\nEmail State Information Center\n\nFind an Agency\n\nCall: 1-800-457-8283\n\nText: 1-888-311-1846\n\nQuick Information\n\nIN.gov User Survey\n\nAdvanced Search\n\nPolicies\n\nSitemap\n\nIN.gov FAQs\n\nState Employee\n Resources\n\nState Information\n\nMaps & Information\n\nIN.gov News &\n Events\n\nEmail Updates\n\nIndiana Code\n\nIndiana Administrative Code\n\nAwards\n\nReport\n Accessibility Issues\n\n Copyright © 2026 State of Indiana - All rights reserved.",
