      "url": "https://github.com/vadim-cebanu/baby-tools/pull/1",
      "excerpt": "## Summary\r\nThis pull request adds product tags to the Baby Tools World shop.\r\n\r\n## Changes\r\n- Add `Tag` model with `name`, `created_at` and `updated_at`\r\n- Add optional ManyToMany `tags` field to `Product`\r\n- Register `Tag` in the Django admin and add a tag filter to `ProductAdmin`\r\n- Show product tags on the product detail page (\"Product-Tags\", or \"no tags available\" if empty)\r\n- Load `SECRET_KEY` from environment variables\r\n- Add flake8 configuration\r\n\r\n## Still to do\r\n- [x] Clear the review form after a successful submission\r\n- [x] Update README (Quickstart, Usage, Docker)\r\n- [x] Pin all package versions in `requirements.txt`\r\n\r\n## How to test\r\n1. Copy `example.env` to `.env` and set a `SECRET_KEY`\r\n2. Run `python manage.py migrate`\r\n3. Run `python manage.py runserver`\r\n4. Create tags in the admin panel and assign them to a product\r\n5. Open the product detail page and check the tags",
